# AWS Services Used

## Amazon S3

Stores raw and processed datasets.

---

## AWS Glue

Performs ETL using PySpark.

---

## AWS Glue Catalog

Maintains metadata for processed datasets.

---

## Amazon Athena

Executes serverless SQL queries directly on S3.

---

## Amazon Redshift

Acts as the cloud data warehouse for analytical queries.

---

## Amazon QuickSight

Creates interactive dashboards and business reports.

---

## AWS IAM

Manages secure access to AWS resources.
